#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:1
msgid "🌟 PipelineStore"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:3
msgid ""
"**PipelineStore** is a composite store built by **chaining multiple Store"
" implementations** together to form a data transfer pipeline."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:5
msgid ""
"Currently, the pipeline supports a chain composed of **Cache Store** and "
"**Posix Store**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:7
msgid "In this chained pipeline:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:8
msgid "**Cache Store** handles data transfer between the **Device and Host**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:9
msgid ""
"Once the data flows from the Device to the Host, **Posix Store** is "
"responsible for transferring the data between the **Host and POSIX-"
"compliant persistent storage**, such as local disks, SSDs, or remote NFS "
"(including NFS over RDMA) mount points."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:11
msgid ""
"At present, only this Store chain is supported.   Additional Store "
"implementations will be developed in the future and **chained** into the "
"pipeline to enable more flexible and extensible transfer paths."
msgstr ""

