#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:60
msgid "Configuration for Prefix Caching"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:62
msgid ""
"Modify the UCM configuration file to specify which UCM connector to use "
"and where KV blocks should be stored.   You may directly edit the example"
" file at:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:65
msgid "`unified-cache-management/examples/ucm_config_example.yaml`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:67
msgid "A minimal configuration looks like this:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:88
msgid "Required Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:90
msgid ""
"**ucm_connector_name**:   Specifies `UcmPipelineStore` as the UCM "
"connector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:93
msgid ""
"**store_pipeline: \"Cache|Posix\"**   Specifies a pipeline built by "
"**chaining the Cache Store and the Posix Store**.   In this chained "
"pipeline, the Cache Store handles data transfer between the **Device and "
"Host**,   and once the data reaches the Host, the Posix Store transfers "
"it between the **Host and POSIX-compliant persistent storage**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:98
msgid ""
"The pipeline must be registered in advance in   `unified-cache-"
"management/ucm/store/pipeline/connector.py` under `PIPELINE_REGISTRY`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:101
msgid "Currently, **only this Store chain is supported**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:104
msgid ""
"**storage_backends**:   Directory used for storing KV blocks. Can be a "
"local path or an NFS-mounted path.   **⚠️ Replace `\"/mnt/test\"` with "
"your actual storage directory.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:108
msgid "Optional Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:110
msgid "Parameters inside `ucm_connector_config`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:112
msgid ""
"**store_health.enabled** *(optional, default: false)* Whether to wrap "
"each Store in the Pipeline with `HealthBreakerStore`. Set it to `true` to"
" enable automatic health probing, circuit breaking, and recovery. This "
"setting does not control a Breaker explicitly added as a Store by a "
"custom Pipeline implementation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:117
msgid ""
"**io_direct** (optional, default: `false`):   Whether to enable direct "
"I/O. For Posix Store, this bypasses the OS page cache when "
"reading/writing files to disk."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:120
msgid ""
"**cache_buffer_capacity_gb** *(optional, default: 256)*   The capacity of"
" the Cache Store host-side buffer in GB.   The default value of 256 GB is"
" sufficient in most cases.   When using models like MLA, make sure "
"`/dev/shm` has enough space,   or set this parameter to a smaller value."
"   Note: when multiple data-parallel instances run on the same node,   "
"each creates its own Cache Store buffer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:128
msgid ""
"**posix_capacity_gb** *(optional, default: 0)*   The maximum storage "
"capacity in GB for the Posix Store.   When set to a value greater than 0,"
" garbage collection (GC) is enabled   and will recycle disk space when "
"the threshold is reached.   When set to 0 (default), no capacity limit or"
" GC is applied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:134
msgid ""
"**posix_io_engine** *(optional, default: \"psync\")*   I/O engine type "
"for the Posix Store. Supported values: `\"psync\"` (pread/pwrite), "
"`\"aio\"` (libaio)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:137
msgid ""
"**use_gdr** *(optional, default: false)*   Enable GPUDirect RDMA "
"transfers for Cache Store/Pc Store H2D and D2H copies.   This requires an"
" RDMA-capable NIC, a working GPUDirect RDMA environment,   and building "
"UCM with `ENABLE_GDR=1`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:142
msgid ""
"**waiting_queue_depth** *(optional, default: 8192)*   Depth of the "
"waiting queue for transfer tasks in the Cache Store."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:145
msgid ""
"**running_queue_depth** *(optional, default: 524288)*   Depth of the "
"running queue for transfer tasks in the Cache Store."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:148
msgid ""
"**timeout_ms** *(optional, default: 30000)*   Timeout in milliseconds for"
" external interfaces (applies to both Cache Store and Posix Store)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:151
msgid "Top-level parameters (outside `ucm_connector_config`):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:153
msgid ""
"**enable_event_sync** *(optional, default: true)*   Whether to enable "
"event synchronization.   When using `UcmNfsStore`, this should be set to "
"`false`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:157
msgid ""
"**use_layerwise** *(optional, default: true)*   Whether to use layerwise "
"loading/saving of KV cache blocks.   Enabled by default for "
"`UCMConnector`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:161
msgid ""
"**hit_ratio** *(optional)*   When set, limits the number of hit tokens to"
" `hit_ratio × num_prompt_tokens`.   Useful for controlling the proportion"
" of cached tokens that are actually loaded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:165
msgid ""
"**enable_record_traces** *(optional, default: false)*   Whether to record"
" request traces.   When enabled, logs per-request traces (timestamp, "
"input_length, output_length, hash_ids).   Each hash_id takes 32 bytes. "
"Enable only when needed,   and configure `UCM_LOG_MAX_FILES` and "
"`UCM_LOG_MAX_SIZE` accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:171
msgid ""
"**use_lite** *(optional, default: false)*   Whether to use the UCM Lite "
"Connector.   UCM Lite Connector works with Fake Store to skip actual KV "
"dump/load operations,   only collecting hit ratio statistics.   It is "
"suggested to first collect hit ratio statistics and confirm with relevant"
"   project members whether to adopt UCM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:178
msgid ""
"**persist_token_threshold** *(optional, default: 0)*   Minimum token "
"threshold for KV persistence.   Requests with fewer tokens than this "
"threshold will skip KV load and dump operations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/pipeline_store.md:182
msgid ""
"**metrics_config_path** *(optional)*   Path to a UCM metrics "
"configuration YAML file.   When set, enables UCM metrics that can be "
"monitored online via Grafana and Prometheus."
msgstr ""

